					<ShowLabel>false</ShowLabel>
					<DrawMode>SHAPE_DRAW_2D</DrawMode>
					<EmbeddedIcon>false</EmbeddedIcon>
					<Z>0</Z>
					<Rotation>0.0</Rotation>
					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[1. OPTIMIZATION - cheapest fleet that keeps >= 95% same-day delivery

Varies: robots 1-6, charging pads 1-3, batching fill 40-100%.
Minimizes root.monthlyCost() = robots x robotCostPerDay x days + energy + late items + waiting time.
Requirement: same-day delivery >= 95%. workDays per iteration (default 30; lower it for a faster test), 30 iterations.
Results: one row per run in output/exp_optimization.csv (next to the model). Runs in virtual time, no animation.]]></Text>
