					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[5. CALIBRATION - match Ricardo's observed trip times

Target: trip Building 3 mailroom -> Building 1 (obsTripQuietMin, obsTripRushMin - Ricardo's experience).
Fits metersPerTwinUnit (map scale) and crowdImpactPerWalker (slow-down per student).
Minimizes root.calibrationError() = squared difference; workDays per iteration (5 days is enough for calibration), 40 iterations.
Results: one row per run in output/exp_calibration.csv (next to the model). Runs in virtual time, no animation.]]></Text>
					<Font>
						<Name>SansSerif</Name>
						<Size>14</Size>
						<Style>0</Style>
					</Font>
					<Alignment>LEFT</Alignment>
