			<Presentation>
				<Text>
					<Id>1795478206707</Id>
					<Name><![CDATA[infoText]]></Name>
					<X>40</X><Y>40</Y>
					<Label><X>0</X><Y>-10</Y></Label>
					<PublicFlag>true</PublicFlag>
					<PresentationFlag>true</PresentationFlag>
					<ShowLabel>false</ShowLabel>
					<DrawMode>SHAPE_DRAW_2D</DrawMode>
					<EmbeddedIcon>false</EmbeddedIcon>
					<Z>0</Z>
					<Rotation>0.0</Rotation>
					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[3. MONTE CARLO - 100 random months with the current settings (95% confidence intervals)

Every run uses a different random seed: vendor times, volumes, sorting times, students.
Use the spread of same-day %, hours to locker and robot km to show the risk range.
Results: one row per run in output/exp_monte_carlo.csv (next to the model). Runs in virtual time, no animation.]]></Text>
					<Font>
						<Name>SansSerif</Name>
						<Size>14</Size>
						<Style>0</Style>
					</Font>
					<Alignment>LEFT</Alignment>
				</Text>
				<Text>
					<Id>1795478226761</Id>
					<Name><![CDATA[t1795478226762]]></Name>
					<X>40</X><Y>200</Y>
					<Label><X>0</X><Y>-10</Y></Label>
					<PublicFlag>true</PublicFlag>
					<PresentationFlag>true</PresentationFlag>
					<ShowLabel>false</ShowLabel>
					<DrawMode>SHAPE_DRAW_2D</DrawMode>
					<EmbeddedIcon>false</EmbeddedIcon>
					<Z>0</Z>
					<Rotation>0.0</Rotation>
					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[]]></Text>
					<TextCode><![CDATA["Months simulated: " + mcRuns + (mcRuns < 2 ? "" : String.format(java.util.Locale.US, "     95%% CI:  same-day %.1f ± %.2f %%   |   hours to locker %.2f ± %.3f   |   robot km %.0f ± %.0f   |   cost $%.0f ± %.0f", mcSameDayH.mean(), 1.96 * mcSameDayH.deviation() / Math.sqrt(mcRuns), mcHoursH.mean(), 1.96 * mcHoursH.deviation() / Math.sqrt(mcRuns), mcKmH.mean(), 1.96 * mcKmH.deviation() / Math.sqrt(mcRuns), mcCostH.mean(), 1.96 * mcCostH.deviation() / Math.sqrt(mcRuns)))]]></TextCode>
