					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[4. SENSITIVITY - what if Amazon volume grows?

Varies amazonPackagesPerDay 10 -> 60 (step 10), 3 replications each.
Shows how same-day %, waiting time, robot km and cost react to more packages.
Results: one row per run in output/exp_sensitivity.csv (next to the model). Runs in virtual time, no animation.]]></Text>
