					<Z>0</Z>
					<Rotation>0.0</Rotation>
					<Color>-16777216</Color>
					<Text><![CDATA[4b. SENSITIVITY - what if the robots' batteries drain faster?

Varies batteryUsePctPerKm 5 -> 20 % per km (step 3), 3 replications each.
Shows how charging queues, same-day %, waiting time and cost react to weaker batteries.
Results: one row per run in output/exp_sensitivity_battery.csv (next to the model). Runs in virtual time, no animation.]]></Text>
